    "title": "Illinois vs VCU schedule, TV channel, how to watch March Madness game",
    "text": "Updated March 20, 2026, 9:29 a.m. MTNo. 11 seed VCU and No. 3 seed Illinois play in a March Madness NCAA Tournament men's college basketball game on Saturday, March 21.Here's what to know about the time, TV channel, streaming information and announcers for the South Region March Madness second-round game.VCU defeated No. 6 seed North Carolina in overtime in the first round of the NCAA Tournament, 82-78.Illinois beat No. 14 seed Penn in the Round of 64 of March Madness, 105-70.The winner of this game will advance to the Sweet 16 of the NCAA Tournament.How to watch March Madness: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game schedule, TV channelsWatch Illinois vs VCU on FUBO (free trial)What time is the VCU vs Illinois March Madness game?The Illinois vs VCU NCAA Tournament March Madness second-round game is scheduled for 4:50 p.m. MST on Saturday, March 21.Join the madness: USA TODAY Bracket Challenge | Survivor Pool | Printable bracket | Your picks vs expertsWhat channel is the Illinois vs VCU March Madness game on?The VCU vs Illinois Round of 32 March Madness NCAA Tournament game can be seen on CBS.March Madness picks: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round score predictionsHow can I stream the VCU vs Illinois March Madness game?Illinois vs VCU can be streamed on FUBO and other streaming services that carry CBS. FUBO offers a free trial.Who are the announcers for the Illinois vs VCU March Madness game?Ian Eagle will have the play-by-play call of the VCU Rams vs Illinois Fighting Illini NCAA Tournament Round of 32 game, with Bill Raftery and Grant Hill as the analysts and Tracy Wolfson as the reporter for the March Madness second-round matchup.March Madness odds: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game oddsReach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
